{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are inversely proportional and positive. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> increases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/f/03f019000e7e4e14a3379d05327eb7db704d2897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> decreases by \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/2/642539b7314182836ee6b85ecbb7516e43e9420c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ p\\%\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{p}{1+p}\\%\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{100}{p}\\%\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{p}{100+p}\\%\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{100p}{100+p}\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"589\" height=\"41\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/5/8156f637a214835f70bda208ecdaab690ec43432.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100+p}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" /> when it is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />%. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/5/f35f6abd100743aca1c038878add1c43f905936e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{100+p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"61\" height=\"41\" />, and so it is decreased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c8bf2ddef13fd5792275fab35949623880bfbd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p}{100+p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"61\" height=\"36\" /> times itself. Therefore, it is decreased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/3/a03dd772b136301cf93b338a76f2f681780b475d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100p}{100+p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"64\" height=\"42\" />%, and so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Pr